ttlefield against the aliens. Yamato and his team plunge into the fray and rack up victories thanks to Musashi's abilities. But the aliens' combat machines undergo a shocking transformation and their enemies turn the tables on them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ko07X9lVgTUqSqrElG5aPEnQ4Qx.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12296","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87502","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33737","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"129553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"402182","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"76845","synopsis":"Possessing Asuna's body, Arshem stalks Yamato in order to kill him, but fails when he notices her. In an attempt to maintain her cover, she lies and tells him she's in love with him. Later, Yamato and his teammates learn that one of the pilots has been assassinated.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v7YSpD3Ygkh9OrKyTJY2vhbwuRj.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Possessing Asuna's body, Arshem stalks Yamato in order to kill him, but fails when he notices her. In an attempt to maintain her cover, she lies and tells him she's in love with him. Later, Yamato and his teammates learn that one of the pilots has been assassinated.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v7YSpD3Ygkh9OrKyTJY2vhbwuRj.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12296","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"87502","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"33737","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"129553","scope":"s1","seasonNumber